                <mxCell id="n_rule" value="The dependency rule, and why it holds&#xa;&#xa;Models knows nothing about Core or Infrastructure &#8212; which is what lets&#xa;ProjectItem consume a render&#39;s results (ProcessingSliceRecord,&#xa;AppliedCanvasProfile) without depending on anything image-processing.&#xa;&#xa;The pipeline never touches ProjectItem, Workspace or a serializer: it takes&#xa;a copy of the input list and returns records the caller applies. That is what&#xa;makes it safe to run on a worker thread while the GUI holds the workspace." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="630" y="1013.75" width="430" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="2" value="CONSUMERS &#8212; separate repositories, no library code" style="swimlane;" vertex="1" parent="1">
